OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as historic pond remains a
OL,4,Apuddle despite rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is "sadness" and "concern" as a
OL,7,Fmuch-loved 300-year-old pond remains
OL,8,Fdry months after this summer's extreme
OL,9,Fheat.
OL,11,FThe Crammer in Devizes has no natural
OL,12,For artificial water source, making it
OL,13,Freliant on rain and road runoff.
OL,15,FResidents describe it as the "focal
OL,16,Fpoint" of the Wilshire town and say
OL,17,Fthey are "sad" and "concerned" the
OL,18,Fwater has not returned despite rain
OL,19,Fthroughout September.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
