OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as historic pond remains a
OL,4,Apuddle despite rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Iain Wallis said filling the
OL,7,Fpond with artificial water would be
OL,8,Fexpensive and unlikely when there are
OL,9,Fhosepipe bans.
